    "engine": "knitr",
    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"The Psychology of the Perfect Shot Choice\"\nsubtitle: \"What LeBron James teaches about decision-making under pressure\"\nauthor:\n  - name: \"King Matayo\"\n    email: kingmatayo.thefirst@gmail.com\ndate: 12/22/2024\nimage: \"../assets/images/prospect.jpg\"\ncategories: [Appendix, Psychology, Decision-Making]\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n> *\"I like criticism. It makes you strong.\"* – LeBron James\n\n## The Science of Decision-Making\n\nIn 1979, psychologists Daniel Kahneman and Amos Tversky introduced **Prospect Theory**, a groundbreaking framework for understanding how humans make decisions under uncertainty. Their key insight: we don't evaluate outcomes objectively—we evaluate them relative to a reference point.\n\n**LeBron James' shot selection provides a perfect case study for these principles in action.**\n\n## Loss Aversion on the Court\n\nProspect Theory's most famous finding is **loss aversion**: losses hurt roughly twice as much as equivalent gains feel good. This creates asymmetric decision-making.\n\nIn basketball, this manifests in fascinating ways:\n- Players protect leads more aggressively than they chase deficits\n- Late-game decisions become more conservative\n- High-stakes moments trigger risk-averse behavior\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"highchart html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-79573c67e3b8bcb48e09\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-79573c67e3b8bcb48e09\">{\"x\":{\"hc_opts\":{\"chart\":{\"reflow\":true,\"type\":\"column\"},\"title\":{\"text\":\"LeBron's Field Goal % by Quarter\"},\"yAxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"FG%\"},\"min\":40,\"max\":55},\"credits\":{\"enabled\":false},\"exporting\":{\"enabled\":false},\"boost\":{\"enabled\":false},\"plotOptions\":{\"series\":{\"label\":{\"enabled\":false},\"turboThreshold\":0},\"treemap\":{\"layoutAlgorithm\":\"squarified\"},\"column\":{\"dataLabels\":{\"enabled\":true,\"format\":\"{y:.1f}%\"}}},\"subtitle\":{\"text\":\"How does performance change as pressure increases?\"},\"xAxis\":{\"categories\":[\"Q1\",\"Q2\",\"Q3\",\"Q4\"]},\"series\":[{\"data\":[48.1,52.8,52.5,49],\"name\":\"FG%\",\"colorByPoint\":true,\"colors\":[\"#860038\",\"#860038\",\"#860038\",\"#FFD700\"]}]},\"theme\":{\"colors\":[\"#f1c40f\",\"#2ecc71\",\"#9b59b6\",\"#e74c3c\",\"#34495e\",\"#3498db\",\"#1abc9c\",\"#f39c12\",\"#d35400\"],\"chart\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#34495e\"},\"xAxis\":{\"gridLineDashStyle\":\"Dash\",\"gridLineWidth\":1,\"gridLineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"lineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"minorGridLineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"tickColor\":\"#46627f\",\"tickWidth\":1,\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},\"yAxis\":{\"gridLineDashStyle\":\"Dash\",\"gridLineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"lineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"minorGridLineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"tickColor\":\"#46627f\",\"tickWidth\":1,\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},\"legendBackgroundColor\":\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)\",\"background2\":\"#505053\",\"dataLabelsColor\":\"#B0B0B3\",\"textColor\":\"#34495e\",\"contrastTextColor\":\"#F0F0F3\",\"maskColor\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\",\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}},\"subtitle\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#666666\"}},\"legend\":{\"itemStyle\":{\"color\":\"#C0C0C0\"},\"itemHoverStyle\":{\"color\":\"#C0C0C0\"},\"itemHiddenStyle\":{\"color\":\"#444444\"}}},\"conf_opts\":{\"global\":{\"Date\":null,\"VMLRadialGradientURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/gfx/vml-radial-gradient.png\",\"canvasToolsURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/modules/canvas-tools.js\",\"getTimezoneOffset\":null,\"timezoneOffset\":0,\"useUTC\":true},\"lang\":{\"contextButtonTitle\":\"Chart context menu\",\"decimalPoint\":\".\",\"downloadCSV\":\"Download CSV\",\"downloadJPEG\":\"Download JPEG image\",\"downloadPDF\":\"Download PDF document\",\"downloadPNG\":\"Download PNG image\",\"downloadSVG\":\"Download SVG vector image\",\"downloadXLS\":\"Download XLS\",\"drillUpText\":\"◁ Back to {series.name}\",\"exitFullscreen\":\"Exit from full screen\",\"exportData\":{\"annotationHeader\":\"Annotations\",\"categoryDatetimeHeader\":\"DateTime\",\"categoryHeader\":\"Category\"},\"hideData\":\"Hide data table\",\"invalidDate\":null,\"loading\":\"Loading...\",\"months\":[\"January\",\"February\",\"March\",\"April\",\"May\",\"June\",\"July\",\"August\",\"September\",\"October\",\"November\",\"December\"],\"noData\":\"No data to display\",\"numericSymbolMagnitude\":1000,\"numericSymbols\":[\"k\",\"M\",\"G\",\"T\",\"P\",\"E\"],\"printChart\":\"Print chart\",\"resetZoom\":\"Reset zoom\",\"resetZoomTitle\":\"Reset zoom level 1:1\",\"shortMonths\":[\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\",\"May\",\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Aug\",\"Sep\",\"Oct\",\"Nov\",\"Dec\"],\"shortWeekdays\":[\"Sat\",\"Sun\",\"Mon\",\"Tue\",\"Wed\",\"Thu\",\"Fri\"],\"thousandsSep\":\" \",\"viewData\":\"View data table\",\"viewFullscreen\":\"View in full screen\",\"weekdays\":[\"Sunday\",\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\"]}},\"type\":\"chart\",\"fonts\":[],\"debug\":false},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n\nLeBron's efficiency varies across game situations\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Reference Points and Shot Selection\n\nKahneman and Tversky showed that our decisions depend heavily on our **reference point**—where we start from. For LeBron:\n\n- **When leading**: His shot selection becomes more conservative (protecting the gain)\n- **When trailing**: He takes higher-risk shots (seeking to recover the loss)\n\nThis isn't irrational—it's human psychology in action.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"highchart html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-f181e00d59dcb42296c5\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-f181e00d59dcb42296c5\">{\"x\":{\"hc_opts\":{\"chart\":{\"reflow\":true,\"type\":\"area\"},\"title\":{\"text\":\"LeBron's Shot Selection Evolution (2015-2024)\"},\"yAxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"% of Shots\"}},\"credits\":{\"enabled\":false},\"exporting\":{\"enabled\":false},\"boost\":{\"enabled\":false},\"plotOptions\":{\"series\":{\"label\":{\"enabled\":false},\"turboThreshold\":0},\"treemap\":{\"layoutAlgorithm\":\"squarified\"},\"area\":{\"stacking\":\"normal\"}},\"xAxis\":{\"categories\":[2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024]},\"series\":[{\"data\":[25.9,19.6,24.7,25.1,29.3,32.2,33.9,35.7,30.4,27.8],\"name\":\"3PT\",\"color\":\"#FF9999\"},{\"data\":[30,23.6,22.5,22.3,20.6,18.6,23.3,18.6,21.2,17.3],\"name\":\"Mid-Range\",\"color\":\"#50C878\"},{\"data\":[44.1,56.8,52.8,52.7,50,49.3,42.8,45.7,48.4,54.8],\"name\":\"Paint\",\"color\":\"#99CCFF\"}]},\"theme\":{\"colors\":[\"#f1c40f\",\"#2ecc71\",\"#9b59b6\",\"#e74c3c\",\"#34495e\",\"#3498db\",\"#1abc9c\",\"#f39c12\",\"#d35400\"],\"chart\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#34495e\"},\"xAxis\":{\"gridLineDashStyle\":\"Dash\",\"gridLineWidth\":1,\"gridLineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"lineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"minorGridLineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"tickColor\":\"#46627f\",\"tickWidth\":1,\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},\"yAxis\":{\"gridLineDashStyle\":\"Dash\",\"gridLineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"lineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"minorGridLineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"tickColor\":\"#46627f\",\"tickWidth\":1,\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},\"legendBackgroundColor\":\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)\",\"background2\":\"#505053\",\"dataLabelsColor\":\"#B0B0B3\",\"textColor\":\"#34495e\",\"contrastTextColor\":\"#F0F0F3\",\"maskColor\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\",\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}},\"subtitle\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#666666\"}},\"legend\":{\"itemStyle\":{\"color\":\"#C0C0C0\"},\"itemHoverStyle\":{\"color\":\"#C0C0C0\"},\"itemHiddenStyle\":{\"color\":\"#444444\"}}},\"conf_opts\":{\"global\":{\"Date\":null,\"VMLRadialGradientURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/gfx/vml-radial-gradient.png\",\"canvasToolsURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/modules/canvas-tools.js\",\"getTimezoneOffset\":null,\"timezoneOffset\":0,\"useUTC\":true},\"lang\":{\"contextButtonTitle\":\"Chart context menu\",\"decimalPoint\":\".\",\"downloadCSV\":\"Download CSV\",\"downloadJPEG\":\"Download JPEG image\",\"downloadPDF\":\"Download PDF document\",\"downloadPNG\":\"Download PNG image\",\"downloadSVG\":\"Download SVG vector image\",\"downloadXLS\":\"Download XLS\",\"drillUpText\":\"◁ Back to {series.name}\",\"exitFullscreen\":\"Exit from full screen\",\"exportData\":{\"annotationHeader\":\"Annotations\",\"categoryDatetimeHeader\":\"DateTime\",\"categoryHeader\":\"Category\"},\"hideData\":\"Hide data table\",\"invalidDate\":null,\"loading\":\"Loading...\",\"months\":[\"January\",\"February\",\"March\",\"April\",\"May\",\"June\",\"July\",\"August\",\"September\",\"October\",\"November\",\"December\"],\"noData\":\"No data to display\",\"numericSymbolMagnitude\":1000,\"numericSymbols\":[\"k\",\"M\",\"G\",\"T\",\"P\",\"E\"],\"printChart\":\"Print chart\",\"resetZoom\":\"Reset zoom\",\"resetZoomTitle\":\"Reset zoom level 1:1\",\"shortMonths\":[\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\",\"May\",\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Aug\",\"Sep\",\"Oct\",\"Nov\",\"Dec\"],\"shortWeekdays\":[\"Sat\",\"Sun\",\"Mon\",\"Tue\",\"Wed\",\"Thu\",\"Fri\"],\"thousandsSep\":\" \",\"viewData\":\"View data table\",\"viewFullscreen\":\"View in full screen\",\"weekdays\":[\"Sunday\",\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\"]}},\"type\":\"chart\",\"fonts\":[],\"debug\":false},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n\nLeBron's shot selection reflects strategic decision-making\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## The Certainty Effect\n\nProspect Theory also describes the **certainty effect**: we overweight outcomes that are certain relative to outcomes that are merely probable.\n\nIn basketball terms:\n- A guaranteed 2 points (easy layup) feels more valuable than a 50% chance at 3 points\n- Even though expected value favors the three-pointer (1.5 vs 2.0 points)\n\nLeBron's evolution shows him learning to overcome this bias—taking more three-pointers as analytics proved their value.\n\n## Framing Effects in Clutch Moments\n\nHow a situation is framed dramatically affects decision-making. Consider two scenarios:\n\n| Frame | Situation | Likely Decision |\n|-------|-----------|-----------------|\n| \"Don't lose the lead\" | Up by 3, 30 seconds left | Conservative, run clock |\n| \"Win the game\" | Same situation | Aggressive, attack |\n\nLeBron has mastered the art of reframing pressure moments. Rather than thinking \"don't miss,\" he thinks \"make the play.\"\n\n## The Data Behind the Decisions\n\nLeBron's career demonstrates sophisticated decision-making that aligns with—and sometimes transcends—Prospect Theory predictions:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"highchart html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-8a02a61a98830c4b84c9\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-8a02a61a98830c4b84c9\">{\"x\":{\"hc_opts\":{\"chart\":{\"reflow\":true,\"type\":\"spline\"},\"title\":{\"text\":\"LeBron's Career Field Goal Percentage\"},\"yAxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"FG%\"},\"min\":40,\"max\":60},\"credits\":{\"enabled\":false},\"exporting\":{\"enabled\":false},\"boost\":{\"enabled\":false},\"plotOptions\":{\"series\":{\"label\":{\"enabled\":false},\"turboThreshold\":0},\"treemap\":{\"layoutAlgorithm\":\"squarified\"}},\"xAxis\":{\"categories\":[2004,2005,2006,2007,2008,2009,2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024]},\"series\":[{\"data\":[41.7,47.2,48,47.6,48.4,48.9,50.3,51,53.1,56.5,56.7,48.8,52.1,54.8,54.2,51,49.3,51.3,52.4,50,54],\"name\":\"FG%\",\"color\":\"#860038\"}]},\"theme\":{\"colors\":[\"#f1c40f\",\"#2ecc71\",\"#9b59b6\",\"#e74c3c\",\"#34495e\",\"#3498db\",\"#1abc9c\",\"#f39c12\",\"#d35400\"],\"chart\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#34495e\"},\"xAxis\":{\"gridLineDashStyle\":\"Dash\",\"gridLineWidth\":1,\"gridLineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"lineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"minorGridLineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"tickColor\":\"#46627f\",\"tickWidth\":1,\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},\"yAxis\":{\"gridLineDashStyle\":\"Dash\",\"gridLineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"lineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"minorGridLineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"tickColor\":\"#46627f\",\"tickWidth\":1,\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},\"legendBackgroundColor\":\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)\",\"background2\":\"#505053\",\"dataLabelsColor\":\"#B0B0B3\",\"textColor\":\"#34495e\",\"contrastTextColor\":\"#F0F0F3\",\"maskColor\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\",\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}},\"subtitle\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#666666\"}},\"legend\":{\"itemStyle\":{\"color\":\"#C0C0C0\"},\"itemHoverStyle\":{\"color\":\"#C0C0C0\"},\"itemHiddenStyle\":{\"color\":\"#444444\"}}},\"conf_opts\":{\"global\":{\"Date\":null,\"VMLRadialGradientURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/gfx/vml-radial-gradient.png\",\"canvasToolsURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/modules/canvas-tools.js\",\"getTimezoneOffset\":null,\"timezoneOffset\":0,\"useUTC\":true},\"lang\":{\"contextButtonTitle\":\"Chart context menu\",\"decimalPoint\":\".\",\"downloadCSV\":\"Download CSV\",\"downloadJPEG\":\"Download JPEG image\",\"downloadPDF\":\"Download PDF document\",\"downloadPNG\":\"Download PNG image\",\"downloadSVG\":\"Download SVG vector image\",\"downloadXLS\":\"Download XLS\",\"drillUpText\":\"◁ Back to {series.name}\",\"exitFullscreen\":\"Exit from full screen\",\"exportData\":{\"annotationHeader\":\"Annotations\",\"categoryDatetimeHeader\":\"DateTime\",\"categoryHeader\":\"Category\"},\"hideData\":\"Hide data table\",\"invalidDate\":null,\"loading\":\"Loading...\",\"months\":[\"January\",\"February\",\"March\",\"April\",\"May\",\"June\",\"July\",\"August\",\"September\",\"October\",\"November\",\"December\"],\"noData\":\"No data to display\",\"numericSymbolMagnitude\":1000,\"numericSymbols\":[\"k\",\"M\",\"G\",\"T\",\"P\",\"E\"],\"printChart\":\"Print chart\",\"resetZoom\":\"Reset zoom\",\"resetZoomTitle\":\"Reset zoom level 1:1\",\"shortMonths\":[\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\",\"May\",\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Aug\",\"Sep\",\"Oct\",\"Nov\",\"Dec\"],\"shortWeekdays\":[\"Sat\",\"Sun\",\"Mon\",\"Tue\",\"Wed\",\"Thu\",\"Fri\"],\"thousandsSep\":\" \",\"viewData\":\"View data table\",\"viewFullscreen\":\"View in full screen\",\"weekdays\":[\"Sunday\",\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\"]}},\"type\":\"chart\",\"fonts\":[],\"debug\":false},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n\nLeBron's overall efficiency has remained remarkably stable\n:::\n:::\n\n\n::: {.callout-tip}\n## Lessons from Behavioral Economics\n\n1. **Recognize your reference point** - Are you playing to win or playing not to lose?\n2. **Overcome loss aversion** - The best decisions often require accepting short-term losses\n3. **Reframe pressure situations** - \"Opportunity\" vs \"threat\" changes behavior\n4. **Trust expected value** - Analytics can overcome psychological biases\n5. **Adapt over time** - LeBron's evolution shows the power of learning\n:::\n\n## Beyond Basketball\n\nThese principles extend far beyond the court:\n\n- **Investing**: Loss aversion causes people to sell winners too early and hold losers too long\n- **Career decisions**: We overvalue job security (certainty) vs growth opportunities (probability)\n- **Negotiations**: Framing as \"gains\" or \"losses\" dramatically shifts outcomes\n\nLeBron's shot selection teaches us that great decision-makers understand their own psychology—and learn to work with it, not against it.\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- Kahneman, D. & Tversky, A. (1979). \"Prospect Theory: An Analysis of Decision under Risk.\" *Econometrica*.\n- Kahneman, D. (2011). *Thinking, Fast and Slow*. Farrar, Straus and Giroux.\n- Thaler, R. (2015). *Misbehaving: The Making of Behavioral Economics*. W.W. Norton.\n",
